\section{Summary}
I have always been interested in building new things, when I got introduced to programming, I asked a question "So is programming like building a model?". Turns out that it is, I can build my own project from scratch and also build it with my own ideas. Programming might seems to be a very challenging work because one mistake can affect the whole project, which I also learned that I must be extremely careful while I am doing with codes. Besides programming, I would say that I am more of an outgoing person, I love doing sports and hanging out with people who can bring me the festivities, it helps me a lot when I am going through a hard time and confusion. 

